{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52260","headline":"诗（幷序） 二十一 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 二十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"观内有妇人（一作「女」），号名是女官。\n各各服梳畋（项谓通「略」），悉带芙蓉冠。\n长裙并金色，横披（一作「被」，张改作「帔」）黄儭单。\n朝朝步虚赞，道声数千般。\n贫无巡门乞，得谷相共飡。\n常住无贮积，铛釜当房安。\n眷属王侵（张改作「役」）苦，衣食远求难。\n出无夫婿见，病困绝人看。\n乞就（一作「与活」）生缘活，交即免饥寒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52260.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52260","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}